OL,3,GNEWSAGarvaghy Road residents gather as
OL,4,AOrange Order march to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,7,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,8,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,9,Fhad been given permission to go ahead
OL,10,Falong the Garvaghy Road with
OL,11,Frestrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
